description:
Design a clock gating cell that controls the propagation of a clock signal. When the enable signal (en) is high, the output (gated_clk) follows the input clock (clk); when en is low, the output is forced to LOW, effectively disabling the clock signal to downstream logic, which helps in power management and reducing dynamic power consumption in digital circuits.
module top_module(
  input clk,
  input en,
  output gated_clk
);

